• /cost now bills gemini-4-argon at Google's introductory rate until 2026-11-30, and gemini-3.8-flash / gemini-3.6-flash (plus gemini-3.7-flash, which routes to 3.8) until 2026-12-31. After those dates it switches to the regular rate. Before this, users were billed about 2x the real price for the length of the promos.
